DC++ integration changes against GeoIP C API v1.6.12.
Copyright (C) 2026 iceman50 (integration changes).
Upstream copyright and LGPL notices are preserved.

* Retain Windows GEOIDs and GeoIP_Win_GEOID_by_id.
* Interpret database paths as UTF-8 and use wide Windows file APIs.
* Parse IPv6 literals with InetPtonA instead of the upstream Windows fallback.
* City record structures are now unchanged upstream; application adapters use
  country_code instead of the removed local country member.

